~ start

Guide: Welcome back.
Guide: You should visit the Seed Shop and buy 5 Corn Seeds.

=> END


~ progress

Guide: The Seed Shop is nearby.
Guide: Buy 5 Corn Seeds and come back to me.

=> END


~ turn_in

Guide: Excellent!
Guide: You bought the Corn Seeds.

do QuestManager.try_complete_quest()

Guide: Now I'll teach you how to farm.

do GameDialogueManager.action_teach_farming()

Guide: First, till the soil.
Guide: Then plant the Corn Seeds.
Guide: Finally, water them every day.

do QuestManager.start_quest("first_harvest")

=> END


~ completed

Guide: Good luck with your first harvest!

=> END